00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:38,000
Tom Horn is a western, action, drama film directed by William Wiard.

3
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:54,000
A renowned former army scout is hired by ranchers to hunt down rustlers but finds himself
on trial for the murder of a boy when he carries out his job too well.

4
00:25:04,000 --> 00:25:10,000
Tom Horn finds that the simple skills he knows are of no help in dealing with the ambitions of
ranchers and corrupt officials as progress marches over him and the old west.

5
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:26,000
Tom Horn, played by Steve McQueen.

