11
01:08:56,000 --> 01:09:02,000
Tom Horn is a 1980 American Western film directed by William Wiard and starring
Steve McQueen as the legendary lawman, outlaw and gunfighter Tom Horn.

12
01:15:12,000 --> 01:15:18,000
It was based on Horn's own writings.

13
01:21:28,000 --> 01:21:34,000
The film explores themes of hero, ranch, trial, shootout, one man army.

14
01:27:44,000 --> 01:27:50,000
The tone is dark and emotional.
